{"year":"2026","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 31st edition was held on January 4, 2026, at the Barker Hangar in Santa Monica, broadcast by E! and USA Network and hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 151254, 'screen_type': person}\">Chelsea Handler</a> for the fourth year in a row. The edition debuted three film categories: Casting and Ensemble, Sound and Stunt Design. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1233413, 'screen_type': movie}\">Sinners</a> led the nominations, with 17, and tied with <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1062722, 'screen_type': movie}\">Frankenstein</a> in number of wins (4), but <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1054867, 'screen_type': movie}\">One Battle After Another</a> took Best Picture, as well as Director and Adapted Screenplay for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 4762, 'screen_type': person}\">Paul Thomas Anderson</a>. The Brazilian film <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1220564, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Secret Agent</a> won Best Foreign Language Film.<br/><br/>*<i>Television awards are not included</i>."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1054867,"name":"One Battle After Another","image_path":"/2peYXW6CoruehDnKJGMjl2NuaNB.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":701387,"name":"Bugonia","image_path":"/6OeJbx1QGDwrlL8SPZeLKjLhhA7.jpg","director":"Yorgos Lanthimos","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1062722,"name":"Frankenstein","image_path":"/rB0tZwNImTT8febX5qVycZ5YVeF.jpg","director":"Guillermo del Toro","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":858024,"name":"Hamnet","image_path":"/njatIGrIlZCxB88UUBC2xgmfCNE.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1069905,"name":"Jay Kelly","image_path":"/4mE7GKRC9rkUqGPoS6t7vkJzUTn.jpg","director":"Noah Baumbach","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1317288,"name":"Marty Supreme","image_path":"/oLWBW1Sg9V8KGgbR3Y8jeEWF2Gi.jp